solution_steps:
We align the decimal points and subtract:
\[
\begin{array}{@{}c@{}c@{}c@{}c@{}c@{}c@{}c}
& & & 2 & . & 4 & 3 \\
- & & & 1 & . & 2 & 0 \\
\cline{1-7}
